*> The parameters of one tunnel walker (carvers.cob CARVER-WALK-CAVE), included under a group: the walker's own random seed, the
*> start position, the radius multipliers, the thickness, the angles, the vertical scale and the first and the last step.
    05 CVK-SEED             BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
    05 CVK-X                FLOAT-LONG.
    05 CVK-Y                FLOAT-LONG.
    05 CVK-Z                FLOAT-LONG.
    05 CVK-HMUL             FLOAT-LONG.
    05 CVK-VMUL             FLOAT-LONG.
    05 CVK-THICK            FLOAT-LONG.
    05 CVK-YAW              FLOAT-LONG.
    05 CVK-PITCH            FLOAT-LONG.
    05 CVK-YSCALE           FLOAT-LONG.
    05 CVK-START            BINARY-LONG.
    05 CVK-MAX              BINARY-LONG.
